{"t":"Steal From Thieves Quest","s":"steal-from-thieves-quest-f76e9","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Bag_Ahmet_5aae88.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Steal From Thieves Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Oasis Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Tales\">Tibia Tales</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(20 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 11, 2007<br/>Christmas Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>...\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Nomad%20%28Basic%29\">Nomads</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hyaena\">Hyaenas</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>100 <a href=\"#/wiki/Brown%20Mushroom\">Brown Mushrooms</a>, 100 <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coins</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<p><b>Note:</b> You can collect <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bag (Ahmet)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bag_Ahmet_5aae88.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Bag%20%28Ahmet%29\">Ahmet's belongings</a> from the <a href=\"#/wiki/Box\">box</a> found (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33131,32662,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33131, 32662, 7)</a>) prior to speaking with him.\n</p><p>Begin by speaking with <a href=\"#/wiki/Ahmet\">Ahmet</a>. He can be found in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33126,32810,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33126, 32810, 6)</a>). Ask him about a <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">Mission</span>, and he will inform you that he was robbed and will ask for your assistance in recovering his <a href=\"#/wiki/Bag%20%28Ahmet%29\">belongings</a>.\n</p><p>Head north to the Oasis in <a href=\"#/wiki/Darama\">Darama</a> and find the box that is hidden behind a Palm south of the Oasis (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33131,32662,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33131, 32662, 7)</a>). Open it to get <a href=\"#/wiki/Ahmet\">Ahmet's</a> robbed things. <b>Note</b>: you will need <b>400oz</b> capacity to collect his <a href=\"#/wiki/Bag%20%28Ahmet%29\">belongings</a>.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ahmets Hidden Bag\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"352\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ahmets_Hidden_Bag_b0713b.png\" width=\"480\"/></span>\n</p><p><i>You see a bag. It weighs 400.00 oz. It contains Ahmet's stolen property.</i><br/>\n</p><p>Return the <a href=\"#/wiki/Bag%20%28Ahmet%29\">bag</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Ahmet\">Ahmet</a> to collect your reward by saying <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">Hi</span> - <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">Mission</span> - <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">Yes</span>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ahmet\">Ahmet</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Hi</b> <br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Ahmet\">Ahmet</a>: Be mourned pilgrim in flesh.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Mission</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Ahmet\">Ahmet</a>: What are you talking about?? I was robbed!!!! Someone catch those filthy thieves!!!!! GUARDS! ...<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Ahmet\">Ahmet</a>: &lt;nothing happens&gt;....&lt;SIGH&gt; Like usual, they hide at the slightest sign of trouble! YOU! Want to earn some quick money?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Yes</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Ahmet\">Ahmet</a>: Of course you do! Go hunt down the thieves and bring back the stuff they have stolen from me. ...<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Ahmet\">Ahmet</a>: I saw them running out of town and then to the north. Maybe they hide at the oasis.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Steal From Thieves Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Hi</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Ahmet\">Ahmet</a>: Be mourned pilgrim in flesh.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Quest</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Ahmet\">Ahmet</a>: Did you find my stuff?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Yes</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Ahmet\">Ahmet</a>: GREAT! If you ever need a job as my personal security guard, let me know. Here is the reward I promised you.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Steal From Thieves Quest</strong></span>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Tales\">Tibia Tales</a></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div></div>","quests":["loose-ends-quest"]}